<p>HeyGen specializes in creating realistic talking head videos with precise lip-sync. Upload a script, choose an avatar (or create a custom one from a single photo), and HeyGen generates a video that looks like a real person speaking naturally. Its AI translation feature preserves your voice and lip movements in 175+ languages (officially updated to 177+ languages and dialects in January 2026).</p>
