<h3>What is the best AI video generator overall?</h3>
<p>Runway Gen-4.5 is a top overall AI video platform in 2026. It offers the most comprehensive feature set including text-to-video generation, video-to-video stylization, inpainting, motion tracking, and professional editing tools — all in one browser-based workspace. For professional creators who need the full AI video production suite, Runway is a standout.</p>

<h3>What is a top free AI video generator?</h3>
